WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.440
For some reason, this thing around the rapture was what everybody talked.

2
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:10.780
So that was dwelled upon a lot, the rapture.

3
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:19.100
Well, now you got to realize this was, like, back in the 1920s, I think.

4
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.540
You know, we didn’t have television . . . Well, a lot of people didn’t have radios.

5
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.580
Most people didn’t have radios back . . . Nobody had electricity.

6
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:26.920
Okay?

7
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.760
So he [Braxton’s father’s cousin, Bud Lyons] was into the scripture and rapture.

8
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.800
He was outside cutting wood one day and he heard this sound.

9
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:40.180
He looked up and he saw this thing in the air coming.

10
00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:47.040
And in his mind, what he saw was the same way angels had been described.

11
00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:58.260
So he automatically in his mind thought the rapture was fixing to take place and the angels was coming down and he didn’t want to get left behind, okay?

12
00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:03.260
So he tried to get the attention of this thing he saw flying, and he couldn’t.

13
00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:25.440
So he ended up climbing on top of the house for a higher vantage point and he became so filled with the belief that he was going to ascend into the heavens with the rapture that he just jumped off the house and thought he was going to ascend and the angel . . . Well, he didn’t.

14
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:26.360
He hit the ground.

15
00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:28.520
He broke an arm and a leg.

16
00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:34.500
He later found out that was an airplane he saw. [Laughs] That was the first airplane he ever seen in his life. [Laughs]
